// An xsd:time is a time of day with no date, and comparing one against a date is
// not defined. This engine gives every time the same reference date so that two
// times can be ordered, and that reference leaked: a date and a time both landed
// on the timeline, so "1972-12-31"^^xsd:date equalled "00:00:00"^^xsd:time and
